/// Show how far a task has got, or that it is running with no total known.
///
/// # Accessibility
///
/// A real `<progress>` with a real `<label for>` provides the role, the value and
/// the busy state. `aria-valuetext` carries `value_label`, and the sweep stops
/// under `prefers-reduced-motion`.
#[component]
